Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.89,1:38:00.27,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1015.2,984)}アシエイト
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.89,1:38:00.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}繼承遺志們的正式儀式
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.64,1:38:03.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}視為十六種族的同意
