Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.77,1:38:07.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基於唯一神之寶座所定的『十條盟約』
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.77,1:38:07.36,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\pos(712,992)}{\pos(732,993.6)}アシエンテ
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.07,1:38:10.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從今天開始 世界改變了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.57,1:38:14.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來 繼續遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.30,1:38:31.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個故事 哪裡是說謊哪裡是真實
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.58,1:38:34.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這可是 把真相全部告訴你的話
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.53,1:38:36.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就不是「不能訴說的神話」了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.73,1:38:39.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然你很惹人討厭的說
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.03,1:38:44.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過撫摸很舒服就原諒你的說
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.27,1:38:46.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊綱
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.93,1:38:48.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊綱碳
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.64,1:38:52.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空 白 史蒂公
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.58,1:38:56.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 你跑哪裡去了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.12,1:38:58.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世上可是有很多可疑的人哦
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.99,1:39:02.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像哥哥和白那樣的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.06,1:39:04.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贏了就跑什麼的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.08,1:39:07.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊綱 這可不行哦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.44,1:39:10.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世上可是有這種怪人存在哦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.55,1:39:15.22,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.80,1:39:19.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這文字是什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.83,1:39:21.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普莉爾
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.63,1:39:23.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在在在
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.14,1:39:25.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能看懂嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.39,1:39:29.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是人類種語言統一前的語言呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.35,1:39:33.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仔細想想 不正是這傢伙的錯嗎 的說
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.39,1:39:35.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克洛妮·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.07,1:39:36.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.43,1:39:38.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.53,1:39:39.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克洛妮·多拉？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.97,1:39:42.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是艾爾奇亞的建國女王
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.63,1:39:45.20,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一生中都沒人見過她哭泣
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.30,1:39:47.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充滿著知性和笑容的才女
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.96,1:39:49.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是多拉家族的驕傲
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.78,1:39:51.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有兩位呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.88,1:39:54.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道… 不認識呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.85,1:39:59.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比… 那好像不是人類種來著
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.96,1:40:06.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊綱覺得自己認識他們的說
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.39,1:40:09.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.84,1:40:15.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界什麼的 其實是十分單純的事物
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.32,1:40:18.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如他感受到的一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.72,1:40:22.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難得我製造出來的單純的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.49,1:40:25.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把它弄的這麼複雜的那群人
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.71,1:40:27.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們一定能將其打倒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.21,1:40:29.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.74,1:40:44.32,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.35,1:40:49.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}開始遊戲吧
